error[B0210]: `==` cannot compare `T?` (it holds `T`)
  --> check/equality.bloom:14:3
   |
14 |   items.first == item
   |   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ functions, views, bindings, pending calls and type parameters have no equality
   |
help: compare a field of it, or take a comparison function: `(T, T) -> Bool`
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#43-soundness-rules
